# AE402 REST API — Curl Reference

> Companion to [`API_SDK_MCP.md`](./API_SDK_MCP.md) (narrative reference) and
> [`openapi.yaml`](./openapi.yaml) (machine schema). This file focuses on
> ready-to-run `curl` examples for every REST endpoint.

**Base URL (dev):** `http://localhost:8000`
**Base URL (prod):** `https://ae402.xyz/backend`

Endpoints marked 🔐 require an `X-Payment` header. See
[`API_SDK_MCP.md § Authentication`](./API_SDK_MCP.md#authentication-x402-payment-protocol)
for the exact signing scheme; the Python SDK handles it automatically.

Legend:
- 🔐 — x402-signed request
- ⚡ — admin/deployer key required
- `$BASE` — export `BASE=http://localhost:8000` before running the snippets

Endpoint count: **64** (verified via `grep '@(app|router)\.' server/*.py`).

---

## 1. Health / System

| Method | Path | Auth | File |
|--------|------|------|------|
| GET | `/` | | server/app.py |
| GET | `/health` | | server/app.py |
| GET | `/stats` | | server/app.py |
| GET | `/contracts` | | server/app.py |
| GET | `/dashboard` | | server/app.py |
| GET | `/wasm/escrow_funder` | | server/app.py |
| GET | `/events` | | server/app.py |
| GET | `/api/v1/events/stream` | | alias of `/events` |

```bash
curl -s $BASE/health | jq
curl -s $BASE/stats | jq
curl -s $BASE/contracts | jq '.contracts | keys'
curl -N $BASE/api/v1/events/stream         # SSE stream, Ctrl+C to stop
```

