## 3. Batch Operations (up to 50 per deploy)

| Method | Path | Auth | File |
|--------|------|------|------|
| POST | `/escrows/batch` | 🔐 | server/app.py |
| POST | `/escrows/batch-release` | 🔐 | server/app.py |
| POST | `/escrows/batch-cancel` | 🔐 | server/app.py |

```bash
curl -s -X POST $BASE/escrows/batch \
  -H 'X-Payment: ...' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"escrows":[{"service_hash":"...","amount":1000,"receiver":"..."}]}' | jq

curl -s -X POST $BASE/escrows/batch-release \
  -H 'X-Payment: ...' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"service_hashes":["...","..."]}' | jq

curl -s -X POST $BASE/escrows/batch-cancel \
  -H 'X-Payment: ...' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"service_hashes":["...","..."]}' | jq
```

