## 4. Multi-Asset / Streaming Escrow (`/escrow` prefix, server/multi_asset.py)

| Method | Path | Auth |
|--------|------|------|
| POST | `/escrow/multi-asset` | 🔐 |
| POST | `/escrow/multi-asset/{service_hash}/release` | 🔐 |
| POST | `/escrow/multi-asset/{service_hash}/refund` | 🔐 |
| POST | `/escrow/multi-asset/{service_hash}/dispute` | 🔐 |
| POST | `/escrow/multi-asset/{service_hash}/resolve` | 🔐 |
| POST | `/escrow/stream` | 🔐 |
| POST | `/escrow/{service_hash}/stream-claim` | 🔐 |
| GET | `/escrow/{service_hash}/stream-status` | |
| POST | `/escrow/atomic-swap/commit` | 🔐 |
| POST | `/escrow/atomic-swap/reveal` | 🔐 |
| GET | `/escrow/cep18-permit-nonce` | |

```bash
curl -s -X POST $BASE/escrow/multi-asset \
  -H 'X-Payment: ...' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"service_hash":"...","token":"AETUSD","amount":"1000000000"}' | jq

curl -s -X POST $BASE/escrow/stream \
  -H 'X-Payment: ...' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"service_hash":"...","token":"AETUSD","total":"1000000000","duration_sec":86400}' | jq

curl -s $BASE/escrow/<service_hash>/stream-status | jq

curl -s -X POST $BASE/escrow/atomic-swap/commit \
  -H 'X-Payment: ...' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"hashlock":"<sha256>","timelock":<unix_ts>,"counterparty":"..."}' | jq

curl -s "$BASE/escrow/cep18-permit-nonce?owner=<account_hash>&token=AETUSD" | jq
```

