## 12. Admin (`/admin` prefix, server/admin_api.py, ⚡ deployer key)

| Method | Path | Auth |
|--------|------|------|
| POST | `/admin/set-arbiters` | ⚡ |
| POST | `/admin/set-release-cap` | ⚡ |
| POST | `/admin/emergency-freeze` | ⚡ |
| POST | `/admin/unfreeze` | ⚡ |

```bash
# All admin endpoints require deployer-key-signed X-Payment
curl -s -X POST $BASE/admin/set-arbiters \
  -H 'X-Payment: <deployer-sig>' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"arbiters":["...","..."]}' | jq

curl -s -X POST $BASE/admin/set-release-cap \
  -H 'X-Payment: <deployer-sig>' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"cap":"1000000000000"}' | jq

curl -s -X POST $BASE/admin/emergency-freeze \
  -H 'X-Payment: <deployer-sig>' | jq

curl -s -X POST $BASE/admin/unfreeze \
  -H 'X-Payment: <deployer-sig>' | jq
```

