## Error Responses

All endpoints return errors as:

```json
{
  "detail": "<human-readable message>",
  "code": "<machine-readable code>"
}
```

Status codes:

| Code | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| 400 | Bad request / validation failure |
| 402 | Payment required (missing / invalid x402 header) |
| 403 | Forbidden (admin endpoint, non-deployer caller) |
| 404 | Escrow / agent / DID not found |
| 409 | State conflict (e.g. dispute on already-resolved escrow) |
| 422 | Unprocessable entity (schema mismatch) |
| 429 | Rate limit exceeded |
| 500 | Internal error |
| 503 | Sandbox refused fallback (`AE402_STRICT=1`, RPC unreachable) |

